# This suite's lock is deliberately NOT tracked.
#
# The root pixi project commits its lock because it pins the production RIFT
# stack. This one is a disposable test environment that runs in CI and on
# assorted developer and access-point machines; a committed lock there just
# churns, goes stale, and pins platforms nobody in that set is using. Let pixi
# re-solve. test/hyperpipe/ tracks no lock either.
pixi.lock
